<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Nza</book>
  <para style="h">Nzabisili</para>
  <para style="toc1">Libuuku la Nzabisili a Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nzabisili a Yowani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Nza</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nzabisili a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yowani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Nduhi a libuuku mo liniili «Apocalypise» mbindulili mu Ingereke ti nzabisili bimbuli bi byasweme.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yowani a asonihi libuuku la Nzabisili peleve hu tsukusu a kama li bilima, hu mbisa a mbutili a Yisu Kristo. Mu taangu mo yiina, mutumi a itaanzi hya Looma akatondo ti babaakongemene nde we inza-nzambi. Bamukristo bakima bali mu umono pasi mu tooni imiinu hya bo, ka bakima a bali mu uhwada mu imiinu mu taangu a lobese ve.</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuuku la Nzabisili lili mu usalila pfwanisili bisiha na bifwaani, fulafula bya Nzuhisini yi Kulu. Matangu na mapiti mali mu umweese matswehi ma libuuku la Nzabisili. Bu huli litangu la tsambu ni byosi bi byakuha, litangu li musamunu ni byosi bi byavelekuha. Piti yi fuuka ni mbiingili na tsyemili. Piti yi mbeenge ni kasa. Bifwaani bikima bi bilahi bili. Mubu ni mbuha yi mabuli ma mali hu tsina matwala ma mabi. Darango ni ifwaani hya mbeene a Kristo, bibulu bili hu tsina lituma la Darango. Babylooni mu Bibila, ni ifwaani hi musyenge wu li na lituma li libi. Ŋaniiŋa ni musyenge a tsomi ŋa hwatsahala lituma la bisu Looma.</para>
  <para style="io1">Itini hyatsomi hya Nzabisili (<char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:1-3:22">1.1–3.22</ref></char>) hili na <char style="em">mihanda tsambu</char> mibaasonehe huli mabundu tsambu ma itaanzi hya Looma ya Asiya mu Turikiya yi nyatihi. Libuuku loosi, baasonehe lo huli mabundu matsambu mo maana (<char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 1:4">1.4</ref>,<ref loc="REV 1:11">11</ref></char>). Mu mihanda mo miina, <char style="em">Yowani li mu uyabisa huli mabundu moosi</char>.</para>
  <para style="io1">Mu itini hya byole hi libuuku (<char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 4-20">4–20</ref></char>) Yowani miikoto hu yulu mutso iteesi hi livupu. Huuna nde li mu umono bisiha bya kimuhili, na li mu ubangula byo. Mu mabuli <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 4-11">4–11</ref></char>, nde li mu umaamweese buni Yisu Kristo ali mu utuma udibula na utsikaha ma libuuku ma Nzuhisini li Likulu. Nde li mu umweese kaka ti Musamu wu Mubwe wa Kristo, li mu utala mabuli moosi. Titswene, mabuli ma <char style="ior"><ref loc="REV 12-20">12–20</ref></char>, mali mu ubangula <char style="em">mudiingu wu munene wa na matwala ma mabi </char> Yisu wa Moonyi, bali mu umweese mu ifwaani hya Mwana Limeme. <char style="em">Mwana Limeme la Nzambi</char> wu aviidi moonyi a nde, we Mwana Limeme li laaveleyaaba dyaambu, li <char style="em">limiibiinga</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mabuli <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 21-22">21–22</ref></char> mali mu uyabisa pangili yi nyatihi, yi Nzambi ali mu uvangimasa. Mu pangili mo yiina, hu li na musyenge, Yeruselemi, wu li mu ukulamana umata hu yulu, we bungodu bwa Nzambi. Mabuli mo mamoole maniima, mali mu usukasa Nzabisili, ka napa Bibila byosi. Mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:24">Mba 3.24</ref> </char> bakeluba bamiidibuha nzila yi yibaabita hu muti a moonyi. Mu Nzabisili <char style="xt"><ref loc="REV 22:2">22.2</ref></char> muti wu li mu uva moonyi, li ŋa butima bu litandala li musyenge. Makaya ma nde mali mu ubeeloso baatu boosi. Libuuku la Nzabisili baasonehe lo mu taangu a pasi, hu bubi buli mu ukana ulutahala bunono mu byosi. Libuuku mo liniili, lili mu uhwadisa banga imiinu mu Kristo mu <char style="em">utelemene </char> matwala ma mabi na mu <char style="em">ukeele</char> mbingili a tsukusu ya Nzambi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mbandihili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Libuuku mo liniili lili na nzabisili yi Yisu Kristo hayaka. Nzambi aviidi nde yo mana nde amweese huli basalili ba nde mambu ma muuvangama masulubete ma. Kristo atsindihi pofi a nde huli musalili a nde Yowani, mu uyabisa nde yo. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Yowani li mu uta imbangi ti moosi ma nde hamoni, mali mambu ma Nzambi na imbangi hya Yisu Kristo. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Kinya yili huli muutu wu li mu utanga libuuku mo liniili! Kinya yili huli ba bali mu uyuha tsangu a mbihulili mo yiniiyi, na ba bali mu ukeelese Mabasonehe muuna! Mu tooni ati, taangu yi mambu mo maana muuvangama, yaaka bebele.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe huli mabundu tsambu ma Asiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Ni me Yowani ndi mu utsonehele huli mabundu tsambu ma mali hu itaanzi hya Asiya:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Nyaha Nzambi wu li, wu aba na wu li mu uya, na mavupu tsambu ma mali ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu hya nde, basyeme benu na bava benu hyenze, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />na nyaha Yisu Kristo nde kaka avanga bumosi mu benu. Nde wu li mbangi wa ngetetee, Pasa-mabeelo, watsomi wu asuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa, nde li kaka Pfumu bapfumu ba toto. Kristo atondo bisu na nde ayobolo bisu mu masumu mu makila ma nde. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Yisu akitusi bisu baa ipfumu hi bangaanga ba Nzambi, mu tooni usalila Nzambi Taata a nde. Nyaha muyusu na matwala biba bya nde taangu yoosi! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Monwaani, nde aka mu uya hutso mayidu! Baatu boosi buumono nde, tso ba baapihi nde kongo mu libanzi. Mabuli moosi ma ŋa toto, sa malila mu tooni a nde. Eye, sa buba buuna! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />«Me ni Alafa na Omenga.» Huleeli Pfumu Nzambi. Nde wu li, wu aba na wu li mu uya, Pungu Matwala.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yowani miimono imono-miisu hya Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Me Yowani, mwaana a ngu a benu, me ndi mu umono pasi na benu, itwadi na benu, me ndi wu Ipfumu hya Nzambi na me ndi na mukonono mu uba wu akangama mu Yisu. Baakangi na baabiti me hu iliiŋa hya Patamose, mu tooni Mukuma a Nzambi na imbangi hya Yisu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Mu ilumbu hya Pfumu, Livupu la Ngidi laakaangi me, na me anzuhi humbisa a me ndaha yi mifudi, we ndaha a kulambeete. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Ndaha yakaleele bunuubu: «Sonehe mutso a libuuku, mambu moosi ma we li mu umono. Na tsindaha libuuku mo huli mabundu tsambu maniima: hu Efeso, hu Simirine, hu Perengami, hu Tyatire, hu Sarede, hu Filadelefi na hu Lawodise.»<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Me kinguha mu umono na akatsuha huli me, me amoni bisiha tsambu bya wolo, bi bubaasuusala minda. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Ŋa hati la byo, me amoni hya moonyi hi hyafwanina na muutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hya moonyi hi hyafwanina na muutu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbindulili ni ti «mwaana a muutu».</char></note>. Muutu mo wuuna aba alwaata muroopo wu akulamana natee hu miilu. Nde aba alwaata mudi a luungu wa wolo mu butulu bwa nde. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Mutswe na naanga a nde, byaba byafuuka we myoso mi mifuuka mi limeme, lifuuku li lafulala vee. Miisu ma nde maakalulaha we ludi la mbaahu. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Miilu mya nde myakamwedeme we itali hi himiibeenge hutso a mbaahu. Na ndaha a nde yaakapala we kele mapuba ma manene. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Nde aba akaanga bamvwelele tsambu ŋa kaka la nde la mbahala. Na sabila a mengo moole wu ato, akapala mutso munywa a nde. Hiinzi hya nde hyakamwedeme we taangu a mwangulu. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ŋa me amoni nde, me ambwidi ŋa miilu mya nde, we muutu wu miikwa. Nde asuusili me kaka la mbahala, na aleeli: «A baa na boomo ve! Ni me ndi watsomi na wa tsukusu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:6">Esa 44.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:12">48.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:2">49.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Me ndi muutu wa moonyi. Me amba amiikwa, ka bunuubu me ka moonyi mu bilima na bilima. Me ndi na batsaafi baa lipfu na baa tsi a babaakwa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Sonehe mambu ma we li mu umono: ma mali mu uvyoho mu taangu mo yiniiyi, na ma mu uvangama mu bilumbu bi byuya. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Mono mbindulili a tswehi bamvwelele tsambu ba we li mu umono ŋa kaka la me la mbahala, na miinda tsambu mya wolo ni yiniiyi: bamvwelele tsambu ni bapofi ba mabundu tsambu mo maana, na miinda tsambu ni mabundu tsambu mo maana.»<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu li musyenge a Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Efeso:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:1">Mono ma mali mu uleele wuuna wu akaanga bamvwelele tsambu ŋa kaka la nde la mbahala na wu li mu uyene ŋa hati li bisiha tsambu bya wolo bi bubaasuusala minda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pasi isiha na matabi tsambu. Pasi tabi na wa nde mwinda.</char></note>: <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />“Me nzaabi mbiili a we, pasi yi we amono na mukonono a we. Me nzaabi ti we utwala ukuunda banga bukanyi ve. We akete boosi ba bali mu uleele ti bo biluumbi bali, ka bo a bali byo ve. Na we asoolo ti bo banga mapfuta. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />We li na mukonono, we amono pasi mu tooni a me, na we a hakolo ve. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ka me ndi na dyambu limosi li me ndi mu utsyembe we. We a hasaalatondo me we hu mbandu ve. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Yibuhala moonyi mu mutaabu wu we asakuha, sobo mbiili a we, na futahala mavaanga ma we matsomi. Tso a buuna ve, me tsa nziila we, na umaasa isiha hya we hya wolo hi bubaasuusala minda ŋa mbuha a hyo. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ka bumosi we me, dyambu lilibwe li lili mu we ni linili: we abele mavaanga ma baatu ba Nikola.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Nyaha pasi muutu nga matswi, ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:7">Huli wu ubiinga, me upa mbutu muti a moonyi mu udya. Muti mo wuuna ni wu li hutso a paradiso a Nzambi.”»<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Simirine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Simirine:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:8">Mono mamali mu uleele wuuna wu li watsomi na watsukusu, wu akwidi na asuuha mu babaakwa: <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />“Me nzaabi mapasi ma we na buyaha bwa we. Ka mu mbuli, we isina we li. Me nzaabi makusa ma ba bubaabilumana ti bo Bayudaayo bali, ka bo a bali Bayudaayo ve: bo bali binama bya kabu la Saatana. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />A mono tsisu mu tooni a pasi yi we umono ve. Yuha: Saatana ulobese benu, na ubwaha ba balahi mu benu mu kondaayi. Buutsuta benu mu bilumbu kuumi, ka ba ngetetee nate lipfu, na me upa we mutata a moonyi wu bilima na bilima.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Nyaha pasi muutu nga matswi, ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:11">Wu ubiinga mudiingu, a huuba na boomo bu lipfu la moole ve.”»<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Perengami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Perengami:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:12">Mono ma mali mu uleele wuuna wu li na sabila wu ato, nga a mengo moole: <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />“Me nzaabi hu we li mu utsahala. Ni huuna hu huli na kiti-ipfumu hya Saatana. Ka we asinzakangama mu me. We a hatimba imiinu mu me ve, tso mu taangu yi baadubi Antipaasi, mbangi a me wa ngetetee, hu musyenge a benu, huuna hu Saatana ubaatsahala. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Ka me ndi na mwa masyembo ma usa we. Huli we, we na baatu ba baakangama mu ndongisili a Balaami. Nde wunuwu, akasimbalala Balaaki mu utehele baana ba Isereli mweto. Mana bo badya banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita, na mana bo basalila banzambi bakima. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ni bumosi, we li kaka na baatu ba baakangama mu ndongisili a Nikola. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Ni mu buuna, sobo mbiili. Tso a buuna ve, me ndi bebele mu uyiila we, na me tsa nza na sabila wu ubaapala mu munywa a me, mu ulwanisa baatu mo baana.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Nyaha, pasi muutu nga matswi, ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:17">Huli wu ubiinga, me upa nde maane ma masweme. Me upa kaka huli muutu muutu, manya li lifuuka libaasonehe nduhi yi nyatihi yi pasi muutu haveleyaba, ka ndulu muutu wu uyaka lo.”»<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Tyatire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Tyatire:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 2:18">Mono ma Mwana a Nzambi ali mu uleele, nde wu miisu mali mu ululaha we mbaahu, na wu miilu mili mu umwedeme we itali hi himiibeenge hutso a mbaahu: <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />“Me nzaabi mbiili a we, litondo la we, bungetetee bwa we, isalu hya we, na mukami a we. Me nzaabi ti mavaanga ma we ma tsyelele, maalutahala matsomi bulahi. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ka li me ndi mu utsyembe we ni ti: we li mu uva bunyanga huli Yenzabeli, mukaasu wu li mu ubilumana ti nde mumbihuli a Nzambi. Nde li mu udungasa basalili ba me, mu usimbalala bo mu usambila banzambi bakima na mu udya banyama ba baayeholo huli bifwita. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Me apa nde taangu mu usobo mbiili a nde, ka nde a hanyaha usambila banzambi bakima ve. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ni mu buuna, me umbwaha nde ŋa yulu a taangi minyongi. Me umbwahila kaka mapasi ma manono huli bambaahi ba nde, ba bali mu usambila banzambi bakima na nde, tso bo a basobi mbiili a bo yimbi ve. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Titswene, me utuma uduba baana ba nde. Buuna, Mabundu moosi muuyaaba ti me ni wu ubaakengese matsimi na manzala ma baatu. Me utsyende muutu muutu we bu hu li mavaanga ma nde.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Ka uto ti benu bisu musyenge a Tyatire, bakima a baasiinga ndongisili a bo ve. Benu a laasaha uyaaba mambu ma bo bali mu uteele ‘idongi hi matswehi ma Saatana’ ve. Mono ma me ndi mu unzabisa: Me a handi mu ukwiha benu mupfuna mukima ve. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ndulu, hi benu lili na hyo, kaangaani hyo bubwe-bubwe natee bu me unza.<verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Huli wu ubiinga, huli wu usa litondo la me natee hu tsukusu, me upa nde lituma ŋa yulu mabuli. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Nde utuma mabuli mu matwala ma likaanda li itali na upasa mo we lisanga.<verse eid="REV 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Me mwakulu anzaki matwala mo maana huli Taata a me. Na me upa nde kaka mvwelele a ŋa ngwali.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Nyaha pasi muutu nga matswi, ayuha bubwe-bubwe mambu ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Sarede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Sarede:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 3:1">Mono ma mali mu uleele wuuna wu li na mavupu tsambu ma Nzambi na bamvwelele tsambu: “Me nzaabi mavaanga ma we, me nzaabi ti we na lidumu la muutu wu li moonyi, kaahu, we wu akwa li. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Suuha, hwadisa bi bikini moonyi, bi byaka bebele mu ukwa. Mu tooni ati, mbiili a we a yaakuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi a me ve. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Yibuhala moonyi mu ndongisili yi we ayaki na yi we ayuhi. Baakeelese yo na sobo mbiili. Tso we veliba likanda, me unza huli we, we mwibi, hwavele we uyaaba taangu. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ka mwa bakima ba we mu musyenge a Sarede, a baasumana bikutu bya bo ve. Bo buuyene itwadi na me mu bikutu bi bifuuka. Mu tooni ati, bo bali baatu ba baakuha na byo.<verse eid="REV 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Ni mu buuna, wuuna wu ubiinga, buulwatisa bikutu bi bifuuka. Me a upfwinzala nduhi a nde mu libuuku la moonyi ve. Me utiila nde imbangi ŋa busu bwa Taata a me, na ŋa busu bu bapofi ba nde.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Nyaha pasi nga matswi ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Filadelefi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu li musyenge a Filadelefi:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 3:7">Mono ma mali mu uleele wa Ngidi, wa Mbuli, wu li na tsaafi a mutumi Davidi. Wuuna wu li mu udibula, mana pasi muutu a hadibuha. Wu li mu udibuha, mana pasi muutu a hadibula: <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />“Me nzaabi ndyatili a we, me amiindibula munywa a nzo ŋa busu bwa we, wu pasi muutu huveletwala udibuha. Me nzaabi ti we mwa mifudi ndulu hole li na myo, kaahu we beedi ngetetee mu mambu ma me, na we a hatunala me ve. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Mono ma me upanga mu baatu ba kabu la Saatana, bapfuti mo baana, ba bali mu uleele ti bo Bayudaayo bali. Kaahu bo a bali Bayudaayo ve. Me utuma bo mu ukongemene ŋa busu bwa we. Bo sa bayaaba ti me atondo we. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Mu tooni ati, we akeelese tumili mu uba na mukonono. Me kaka, me ukeelese we mu taangu yi lingebe yiyuya mu tsi yoosi, mu ukete baatu ba ŋa toto. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Me aka mu unza. Bamina hi we li na hyo, mana pasi muutu a havolo mutata a we wa mbingili.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Wuuna wu ubiinga, me ukitusa nde kuunzi mu nzo a Nzambi a me, na nde a hubwepala muuna ve. Me utsonehe mu nde nduhi a Nzambi a me, na yi musyenge a Nzambi a me, ni Yeruselemi yi nyatihi. Yeruselemi yi yili mu ukulamana umata hu yulu, yi Nzambi a me hutsindaha. Me utsonehe kaka nduhi a me yi nyatihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.12</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 62:2">Esa 62.2</ref> </char></note> mu nde.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Nyaha pasi muutu nga matswi ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muhanda huli Libundu la Nzambi li musyenge a Lawodise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />«Sonehele huli pofi a Libundu la Lawodise:</para>
  <para style="pm" vid="REV 3:14">Mono ma mali mu uleele wu bali mu uteele <char style="w">Amen</char>, mbangi wa ngetetee, wa mbuli, wu li mbandu a byosi bi Nzambi havanga: <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />“Me nzaabi ndyatili a we. Me nzaabi ti we a hali piyu ve, we a hali kaka mbaahu ve. Kini beedi we ba piyu, buuve we ba mbaahu! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ka bu we li ndulu hyelele, mbaahu ve, piyu ve, me unduha we mu munywa a me! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />We ubaaleele ti: ‘Me isina ndi na me amiikuukaha busina bu bulahi, me utwala ukiima isiha tso imosi ve.’ Ka we a hali mu uyaaba ti we mutso mapasi na munyongi we li ve! We li iyaha, we li inzimana na we li pene.<verse eid="REV 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Ni mu buuna, me ndi mu upa we ndoongi mu usumba huli me, wolo li bamiimaasa mbindu hu mbaahu, mana we ba isina hya mbuli a mbuli. Suumba kaka bikutu bi bifuuka, mana we lwata na ubwevelemono tsonyi a pene a we. Na suumba biloongo bi utsolese mu miisu ma we, mana we mono. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Me umbaatsuungaha na usyembe boosi ba me atondo. Ni mu buuna, mweese lehemene la we na sobo mbiili.<verse eid="REV 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Yuha, me amiiteleme ŋa munywa a nzo na me ndi mu undodo. Tso muutu yuhi ndaha a me na dibuli munywa a nzo, me ukoto huli nde, me undya itwadi na nde, na nde kaka udya itwadi na me. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Huli wuuna wu ubiinga, me upa nde muswa wu utsahala itwadi na me ŋa kiti-ipfumu hya me. We me, ŋa me ambiingi, me atsahili na Taata a me ŋa kiti-ipfumu hya nde.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Nyaha pasi muutu nga matswi ayuha bubwe-bubwe ma Livupu ali mu uleele huli Mabundu!”»<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Pfumu ŋa yulu a kiti-ipfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Humbisa a maana, me amoni munywa a nzo hu yulu wu aba bwasi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Ndaha yi me anzuhi tsomi mu utoyo na me, yi yaakayuhana we kulambeete, yaaleeli me: «Vaata ŋa, na me umweese we mambu ma muuya hu busu.»<verse eid="REV 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Mu mawasa, Livupu laakaangi me. Me amoni hu yulu, hwaba na kiti-ipfumu. Ŋa yulu a yo, muutu mumosi aba atsahala. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Muutu mo akamwedeme we mamanya ma talu ma bubaateele yazape na saredwane. Muhyama aba adiinga kiti-ipfumu. Muhyama mo akamwedeme we manya la talu li bubaateele emeroode. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Makiti ma ipfumu maku mole mana makima, maaba maadiinga kiti-ipfumu mo. Ŋa yulu a mo, hwaba hwatsahala mikukunyungu maku mole mina. Myo myaba myalwata bikutu bi bifuuka na mitata mya wolo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Mu kiti-ipfumu mo yiina, hwakapala mivedi-a-vedi, kele yi mandaha na banzyedi. Ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu mo yiina, minyangi tsambu myakalulaha. Myo ni mavupu tsambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu mo yiina, hwaba na isiha we mubu wu akamonehele yanga-yanga, yalalaa we mulingu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ŋa butima, hwaba na bivaangu bina bya moonyi bi byakadiinga kiti-ipfumu mo yiina. Bivaangu mo biina byaba na miisu hu busu na hu mbisa. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ivangu hya moonyi hyatsomi hyaba we kosi, hya byole hyaba we mwaana a ngombe, hi bitatu hyaba na hiinzi we hya muutu, na ivangu hi muna hyaba we ngo-nyunyi wu li mu udumaha. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Pasi ivangu hya moonyi mu bibina mo biina, hyaba na mapapi masamunu. Miisu ma malahi maaba maafuungala mapapi mo maana, hu yulu na hu tsina. Butsuhu na nyangu, bivaangu mo biina a bili mu ukolo uyimba bunuubu ve:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">«<char style="w">Wa Ngidi</char>, Wa Ngidi, Wa Ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">ni Pfumu Nzambi, Pungu Matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">wu aba, wu li na wu li mu uya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:18">Ezk 1.18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 10:12">10.12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:2-3">Esa 6.2-3</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Tangu yoosi yi bivaangu bya moonyi bibina bili mu uva muyusu, mu ukuunda, na mu ufutala matondo huli wu atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu, wu li moonyi mu bilima na bilima, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />mikukunyungu maku mole mina myakongimini ŋa busu bwa wu atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu, mu ukuunda wu li moonyi taangu yoosi na ubwaha mitata mya bo ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu. Myo myakaleele:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />«Pfumu Nzambi a bisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">we afwana mu uyaka muyusu, butsitu na matwala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Mu tooni ati, we ni wu avanga bisiha byosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">na ni mu litondo la we byo bili na byavangama.»<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Buuku na Mwana Limeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Titswene, me amoni libuuku li laafwanina na muhanda wu baapoto ŋa kaka la mbahala la muutu wu aba atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu. Libuuku mo aba baasonehe hu hati na hu mbadi a lo. Baaba baahada lo mu mikudu tsambu, na baabadiha bwiingu mu pasi mukudu. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Titswene me amoni pofi nga matwala, wu akata ibila mu mifudi: «Na li na lituma li unyangula mikudu na umaasa bwiingu?» <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ka muutu tso mumosi, tso hu yulu, tso ŋa toto, tso hu tsina a toto, a hatwali udibula libuuku tso utaanga lo ve. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Me andili huulahi mu tooni ati, muutu a hasolihi ve, wu atwali udibula libuuku na utaanga lo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Na mumosi mu <char style="w">Mikukunyungu</char> aleeli me: «Nyaha ulila! Tala! Kosi a buli la Yuda, li imbisa hi mutumi Davidi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:9">Mba 49.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Esa 11.1</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 11:10">10</ref></char></note> miibiinga mudiingu. Nde li na matwala ma umaasa bwiingu na udibula libuuku.»<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Na me amoni Mwana Limeme ateleme ŋa butima bwa kiti-ipfumu, bivaangu bya moonyi mo bibina na mikukunyungu, baaba baadiinga nde. Nde aba we wu baahehe likiingu. Nde aba na matsyembo tsambu, na miisu tsambu, ma maaba mavupu tsambu ma Nzambi ma baatsindihi mu toto yoosi. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Mwana Limeme asusihi na avoli libuuku mo ŋa kaka la mbahala la wuuna wu aba atsahala ŋa yulu a kiti-ipfumu. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Na mu mawasa, hu mbisa a hu nde havoli libuuku, bivaangu mo bya moonyi bibina na mikukunyungu maku moole mina, baatsokimi ŋa busu bwa Mwana Limeme. Mumosi mumosi mu bo aba akaanga mungongo a nde na mambungu ma wolo, ma maaluula mu <char style="w">paha a tsulu yimbwe</char>, ni masambulu ma baatu ba ngidi. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Na bo baakayimba mukuunga wu munyatihi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">«We li na matwala ma uvolo libuuku</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">na ma umaasa bwiingu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ka baahehi we likiingu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">na mu makila ma we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">we ayobili baatu mu ubita bo huli Nzambi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">baatu ba bibandu byosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">baa mandaha moosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">baa mabuli na matsi moosi.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />We akitusi bo baa ipfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">na bangaanga ba Nzambi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">mu usalila Nzambi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">na bo sa babaatuma ŋa toto.»<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Bu me akatali, me anzuhi ndaha bapofi ba balahi. Bo baaba biveeve na biveeve. Bivaangu bya moonyi na mikukunyungu baaba baadiinga kiti-ipfumu. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Bo baakayimba mu ndaha yi mifudi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">«Mwana Limeme wu baadubi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">li wu akuha mu uyaka matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">busina, tsiki, mifudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">butsitu, muyusu na nyimbu!»<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Me anzuhi kaka bivaangu byosi bi Nzambi havangi bi bili hu mayulu, ŋa toto, hu tsina a toto na hutso mubu, byakayimba bunuubu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">«Huli wuuna wu atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">na huli Mwana Limeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">muyusu, butsitu, na matwala</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">mu bilima na bilima!»<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Bivaangu bya moonyi bibina byaleeli: «<char style="w">Amen</char>!» Na <char style="w">Mikukunyungu</char> myakongimini mu ukuunda.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Mwana Limeme miimaasa bwiingu busamunu bwatsomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Titswene me amoni ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bumosi mu tsambu la bwiingu. Na me anzuhi ivangu imosi hya moonyi mu bibina, hyakaduma we nzyedi na ubaaleele: «Yaanga!» <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Me atali na me amoni buuru wu mufuuka. Wuuna wu aba anama ŋa yulu a nde aba akaanga munayi. Nzambi aviidi nde mutata a mbiingili, mana nde ayalwana mu ubaha mbiingili.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bwa moole, me anzuhi ivangu hya moonyi hya byole mu uleele: «Yaanga!» <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Na buuru mukima wu mubeenge we mbaahu apali. Huli wuuna wu aba anama ŋa yulu a nde, baaviidi lituma li umaasa hyenze hya toto. Mana baatu bahehesene makiingu. Na baaviidi nde sabila wu munene.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bu mutatu, me anzuhi ivangu hya moonyi hi bitatu mu uleele: «Yaanga!» Me atali na me amoni buuru mumosi wu mupiinda. Wu aba anama ŋa yulu a nde aba akaanga ŋa kaka, ivolili hya byetso bi byaleme. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Na me anzuhi ya we ndaha mosi ŋa hati li bivaangu bya moonyi bibina. Yo yaakaleele: hyetso imosi hya bele mu denye mumosi. Byetso bitatu bya olose, mu denye mumosi. Ka mu maadi na malamu, a libiiyasa byo ve.<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bu muna, me anzuhi ndaha ivangu hya moonyi hi bina mu uleele: «Yaanga!» <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Me amoni buuru wa mwindu makaya ma tsaha. Wuuna wu aba anama ŋa yulu a nde nduhi «lipfu», na tsi a babaakwa yaakaduukala nde. Baaviidi bo lituma ŋa yulu itsudu himosi mu bitsudu bina bya toto mu uduba baatu mu sabila, mu limbunga, mu wongo na mu bibulu bi bukanyi bya toto.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bu mutaanu, me amoni hu tsina a diiku li bubaatsuha bungodu, mivumu mya ba baadubi mu tooni a ngetetee a bo mu mambu ma Nzambi na mu imbangi hi bo baakatiila mu mo. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Bo baakafulaha mu mifudi: «Mulongisi wa ngidi na wa mbuli, ki taangu we utsundasa baatu ba toto na ufutala bo pindu makila ma bisu?» <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Baaviidi huli pasi muutu mu bo, muroopo wu mufuuka. Na baaleeli bo mu ukeele mu mwaana a taangu hole, nate bu bambaahi ba bo ba isalu na baana ba ngu a bo ba baakiiduba we bo, buukuha.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Titswene, me amoni ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bu musamunu. Toto yanyingimi mu mifudi: taangu yapiindi we tsanda yi piinda; tsuungi wosi abeengi we makila, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />na bamvwelele ba hu yulu baabwiidi ŋa toto, we ŋa muti a fiinge ubaabwisa mbutu yi yaaveleyele, mu ifula hi mifudi. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Yulu laadiimbili we libuuku li bali mu upoto. Bisyelo byosi na biliiŋa baamaasi byo ŋa mambuha ma byo. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Bapfumu ba toto, batumi, bakuutu ba balwani, bisina, baatu banga matwala na baatu bakima, baviha boosi na baatu ba bali bunyanga, baayasweme hutso mirali na hutso mamanya ma bisyelo. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Na bo baakaleele huli bisyelo na mamanya: «Bwani ŋa yulu a bisu na swehani bisu lala na hiinzi hya wu atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu na lala na kesi a Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Mu tooni ati, ilumbu hiinene hya kesi a bo himiito. Na utwala ukunda hyo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Ose 10.8</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:11">Yoe 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:2-3">Sof 2.2-3</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Nzambi miisa iliimbu mu basalili ba nde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Humbisa a mambu mo maana, me amoni bapofi bana baateleme mu matsoso mamana ma toto. Bo baaba baakaanga bifula bi bina bya toto, mana ifula tso imosi hivelefula ŋa toto, tso mu mubu, tso ŋa yulu miti. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Na me amoni pofi mukima, wu akamata hu tsyelo yi taangu yibaapala, na wu aba akaanga isiha hi Nzambi a moonyi ubaakuma biliimbu. Nde afulihi mu mifudi huli bapofi babana ba baayaki lituma li ubiiyasa toto na mubu. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />«A libiiyasa toto ve, tso mubu, tso miti, tswamina bisu likuma iliimbu mu biinzi bi basalili ba Nzambi a bisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 9:4-6">Ezk 9.4-6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Na baayabisi me litangu la ba baasili iliimbu hya Nzambi: biveeve kama maku mana na bina bya baatu (144 000) hi bibandu byosi bya baana ba Isereli: <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Yuda, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Rubeni, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Ngade, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Aseeri, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Nefetali, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Manase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Simeyoni, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Leevi, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Isakaari, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Zabuloni, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Yosefi, biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi ibaandu hya Benyamini.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koonge yinene ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Humbisa a mambu mo maana, me amoni koonge yinene ya baatu, baa muutu tso mumosi huveletwala utaanga. Aba baatu ba matsi moosi, baa bibandu byosi, baa mabuli moosi, na baa mandaha moosi. Bo baaba ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu na ŋa busu bwa Mwana Limeme. Bo baaba baalwata bikuutu bi bifuuka, na mangemvu mu myoho. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Bo baakafulaha mu mifudi: «Liyobolo lili mu umata huli Nzambi a bisu, wu li mu utuma ŋa kiti-ipfumu, na huli Mwana Limeme!» <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Bapofi boosi baaba baadiinga kiti-ipfumu, baadiinga mikukunyungu na bivaangu bya moonyi bibina. Bo baatsokihi biinzi mu toto, ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu na bo baakuundi Nzambi <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />na ubaaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">«Amen! Eye, nyimbu, muyusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">dyeele, pfutili matondo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">likiinzu, matwala na mifudi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">bili bya Nzambi a bisu mu bilima na bilima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amen!»<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Buuna, mumosi mu mikukunyungu afuuli me: «Baatu mo ba baalwata bikutu bi bifuuka, bo baana bali, na bo huni bamiimata?» <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Me apfutili nde: «pfumu a me, we ni wu yaabi.» Buuna nde aleeli me «Bo ni ba baakuundi mbingisili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref></char></note> yi nono. Bo baaswahi miroopo mya bo, na baafuukisi myo mu makila ma Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ni mu buuna, bo bamiiteleme ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi. Bo bali mu ukunda nde butsuhu na nyangu mutso a nzo a nde. Wuuna wu atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu sa akeelese bo. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Bo a bubwemono nzala tso peyu a mamba ve. Tso nyangu, tso ibabudu hi inono a byubwenyengese bo ve. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Mu tooni ati, Mwana Limeme wu li ŋa butima bwa kiti-ipfumu, uba mukeelisi mameme na ubita mo hu mitswe mi banzali baa mamba ma mu baava moonyi. Na Nzambi ukombolo matsanga moosi ma miisu ma bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1-2">Mkg 23.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Esa 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:10">49.10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34.23</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Bwiingu bu mutsambu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ŋa Mwana Limeme hamaasi bwiingu bu mutsambu, yulu loosi laasiidi swii mu itini hya ngunga. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Me amoni bapofi batsambu baateleme ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. Baaviidi bo bakulambeete tsambu. <verse eid="REV 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Pofi mukima ayateleme ŋa pedu a itsuhili hya paha. Nde aba akaanga itsuhili hya paha hya mu wolo. Baaviidi nde paha yindahi ya tsulu yimbwe, mana nde atsuha yo na masambulu ma baatu bangidi, ŋa yulu a diiku la mu wolo li lili ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Mwiiki a paha a tsulu yimbwe na masambulu ma baatu ba ngidi, byakumi umata ŋa kaka la pofi, natee ŋa busu bwa Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Titswene, pofi avoli itsuhili hya paha, aluusi hyo mu makala ma mbaahu ma mu diiku la tsuhili bungodu na abumi hyo ŋa toto. Masulubete, toto yanyingimi, banzyedi baabaandi, hwaba mandaha na mivedi-a-vedi.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapofi bana baatsomi bali mu ufula kulambeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Bapofi tsambu ba baaba na bakulambeete, baakavangama mu ufula bo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Pofi watsomi afuli kulambeete. Mvula mamanya na mbaahu bi byapfuutini na makila, baabwahi byo ŋa toto. Kabu limoosi mu matatu la toto laanyengi, kabu limoosi mu matatu li miti laanyengi, na biimbu byosi bya mamba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:23-24">Pal 9.23-24</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:22">Ezk 38.22</ref></char></note> byaanyengi.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Pofi waboole afuli kulambeete. Isiha imosi hi hyafwanina na isyelo hiinene hi hili mu unyenge, baabwahi hyo hutso mubu. Na Kabu limoosi mu makabu matatu li mubu, laakituhi makila, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />kabu limoosi mu matatu li bivaangu bya moonyi bi byaba hutso mubu laakwidi, na kabu limoosi mu matatu li makuumbi laanyambihini.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Pofi wu mutatu afuli kulambeete. Mvwelele wu munene wu akalulaha we munyangi, abwidi ŋa toto umata hu yulu. Nde abwidi ŋa yulu a kabu limoosi mu matatu li banzali, na ŋa yulu mitswe mi banzali. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Nduhi a mvwelele mo wuuna: «Abisinti»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isiha hi hyafulala kali yi yibaaduba baatu.</char></note>. Kabu limoosi mu matatu la mamba, laakituhi kali, na ba balahi mu baatu ba baanywidi mamba mo maana, baakwidi mu tooni a kali a mamba.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Pofi wu muna afuli kulambeete. Baateti kabu limoosi mu matatu la taangu, la tsuungi na li bamvwelele, mana kabu limoosi mu makabu matatu liba mu piipidi, na mana ilumbu hidymbasa kabu limosi mu matatu li liyalala la hyo, bumosi kaka we ŋa butsuhu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 <char style="xt">Pal 10.21-23</char></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Me ambwetala, me anzuhi ngo-nyunyi mumosi wu akadumaha hu hati a yulu, na ubaaleele mu mifudi: «Lingebe! Lingebe! Ki pila lingebe huli baatu ba bali ŋa toto, mu taangu yi bapofi batatu bakima buufula bakulambeete ba bo!»<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s1">Pofi wu mutaanu li mu ufula kulambeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Pofi wu mutaanu afuli kulambeete. Me amoni mvwelele abwidi ŋa toto umata hu yulu. Baaviidi nde tsaafi a mbeenge ya doheselee. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Mvwelele adibuli mbeenge ya doheselee. Mwiki wu apali muuna, aba afwanina na mwiki a furunu yinene, taangu na livupu byapiindi mu mwiki mo wuuna. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Makooko maapali hutso a mwiki na maatsamuhi ŋa toto yoosi. Baaviidi mo matwala ma we ma bangeenge baa toto. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Baalihi mo mu usa bubi mu biimbu bya toto, tso byosi bi bibaamene, tso miti. Ka ndulu huli baatu ba baavele na iliimbu hya Nzambi mu biinzi bya bo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Baaviidi mo muswa wu unyongese baatu mo baana mu batsungi bataanu. Ka a mu uduba bo ve. Munyongi mibaandu mi makooko, aba we munyongi wu li ŋa ngeenge amiikaha muutu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mu bilumbu mo biina, baatu bu usaha lipfu, ka bo a buusoolo lo ve. Bo bu usaha ukwa, ka lipfu luubata bo.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Makooko mo maaba maafwanina na babuuru ba baamiivangimasa mu mudiingu. Mu yulu mitswe mya bo, hwaba na bisiha we mitata mya mu wolo, na biinzi bya bo byaba we biinzi bya baatu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Mo maaba na naanga yinda, na miinyu ma bo we miinyu ma bakosi. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Matulu ma bo maaba we ma baalwaatisa ikutu hi mudiingu hi itali. Na kele mapapi ma bo, yaaba we kele makuumbi ma midiingu ma babuuru ba balahi bali mu ubita tiinu hu mudiingu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 1:6">Yoe 1.6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Makooko mo maaba na mikila we mikila mi bangeenge mi mili na mikumba. Ni mu mikumba mo miina, mo maaba na matwala ma unyongese baatu mu batsungi bataanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Mukuutu wu akatuma mo, ni pofi a mbeenge ya doheselee. Nduhi a nde mu Ibeleho ni Abadoni na mu ndaha Ingereke ni Apolyoni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abadoni na Apoliyoni mbindulili ni ti mutsali.</char></note>.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pofi wu musamunu li mu ufula kulambeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />«Lingebe» latsomi limiivyoho. Humbisa, mambu moole makima ma lingebe muubweya.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Pofi wu musamunu afuli kulambeete. Buuna, me anzuhi ndaha mosi yapali hu matsoso mamana ma diiku la tsuhili bungodu la mu wolo, li lili ŋa busu bwa Nzambi; <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />ndaha mo yaleeli huli pofi wu musamunu wu aba akaanga kulambeete: «Nyangula bapofi babana ba baahada mapanga ŋa yulu a nzali wu munene wa Efarate». <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Buuna baanyanguli bapofi mo babana baana, ba baaba baavangama mu uduba kabu limoosi mu makabu matatu li litangu la baatu ba ŋa toto, mu ngunga mo yiina, mu ilumbu mo hiina, mu tsungi mo wuuna, mu ilima mo hiina. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Baaleeli me litangu li masadaadu ma ŋa yulu babuuru. Mo maaba makama moole ma bamiliyon (2 000 00000). <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Na mu imono-miisu, me amoni babuuru na baatu ba baaba ŋa yulu a bo: Bo baaba baalwata bikutu bi bitali bi bibeenge we mbaahu. Bikutu mo byaba na mwindu a safiire, na mwindu a suufe. Mitswe mi babuuru myaba we mitswe mi bakosi. Mu minywa mya bo hwakapala mbaahu, mwiki na suufe. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Kabu limoosi mu matatu li litangu la baatu ba ŋa toto, baakwidi mu tooni mapasi mo mamatatu maniima: mbaahu, mwiki na suufe bi byakapala mu minywa mi babuuru. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Mu tooni ati, matwala ma babuuru mali mutso minywa mya bo, na mutso mikila mya bo. Mikila mya bo mili we bataadi. Myo mili na mikumba, mi bo bubaasalila mu usiila baatu bubi.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Kabu la baatu li laasaali, boosi ba baavelikwa mu mapasi mo maana, a baasobi mbiili a bo ve. Bo baahwadi mu ukongemene matengo, bifwita bya wolo, bya mbongo, bi itali hi ibeenge, bi mamanya na bi miti, bi byuveletwala tso umono, tso uyuha, tso uyene.<verse eid="REV 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Bo a baanyahi kaka uduba hwa baatu ve. Ka bo baahwadi mu bungaanga bwa bo, mu mayamba ma bo, na mu mayiba ma bo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pofi na libuuku li likeehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Me amoni pofi mukima, nga matwala, wu akakulamana umata hu mayulu. Mayidu maaba maalwata nde, na muhyama aba adiinga mutswe a nde. Hiinzi hya nde hyakamwedeme we taangu, na miilu mya nde myaba we makuunzi ma mbaahu. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Nde aba akaanga libuuku li likeehe la bwasi ŋa kaka. Nde asuusi hulu hwa mbahala ŋa yulu mubu, na hulu hwa kaasu ŋa toto. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Nde afulihi mu mifudi, we ŋa kosi ubaasiinga. Mu muyamu a nde, banzyedi batsambu baabaandi. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Bu banzyedi batsambu baabaandi, me akiitsonehe ma bo baaleeli, ka me anzuhi ndaha yi yamati hu mayulu yaaleeli: «Keelese tswehi a mambu ma banzyedi batsambu baleeli; a hasonehe mo.»<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Buuna, pofi wu me amoni mu tele ŋa yulu mubu na ŋa yulu a toto, asyenuli hoho hwa mbahala hu yulu, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />na alabi mulabu mu nduhi a wu li moonyi taangu yoosi, wu avanga yulu na byosi bi bili mu yo, toto na byosi bi bili mu yo, mubu na byosi bi bili mu nde. Pofi aleeli: «Ibiinda a hyubweba ve! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ka mu bilumbu bi pofi wu mutsambu huufula kulambeete, Nzambi utswihasa tswehi a nde we bu hu li musamu wu mubwe wu nde haayabisi huli basalili ba nde, mimbihuli.»<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Titswene, ndaha yi me anzuhi yi yamati hu mayulu, yabweleele me bunuubu: «Yene yavolo libuuku li likeehe li lili bwasi ŋa kaka la pofi wu li mu tele ŋa yulu mubu na ŋa yulu a toto.»<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Me atsusihi hu pedu a pofi, na me andeeli nde mu uva me libuuku li likeehe. Nde akaali me: «Volo lo na mina lo; Lo luuluusa moonyi a we kali, ka mutso munywa a we, lo luuba na nyehe we nyuhi.»<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Me apoli libuuku li likeehe ŋa kaka la pofi na me amini lo: lo laaba na nyehe we nyuhi mutso munywa a me, ka bu me andiidi lo, moonyi a me aluuli mu kali<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:8">Ezk 2.8</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:3">3.3</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Buuna, baaleeli me: «We afwana ubwebihula mu nduhi a Nzambi, huli bibandu bi bilahi, mabuli, mandaha na bapfumu.»<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Bambangi boole baa Nzambi a moonyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Titswene, baaviidi me litsootso li lili we libasi li bubaavolo hyetso, na baaleeli: «Teleme, yavolo hyetso hya mbuha a ngidi ya nzo a Nzambi, hya diiku la tsuhili a paha a tsulu, na taanga litangu la baatu ba bali mu ukunda muuna. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ka uto ti litandala la hu mbadi a Nzo a Nzambi, a havolo hyetso hya lo. Siisa lo ŋa muvanga, mu tooni ati baavahula lo huli bangoyi; bo baniiba buuhesolo musyenge a ngidi mu batsungi maku mana na boole. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Mu iveeve imosi makama moole na maku masamunu (1 260) ma bilumbu, me upa lituma luuyayabisa musamu a me huli bambangi ba me boole, ba baalwata matsanda ma bukwili.»<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Bambangi mo baboole, ni miti mya oliive mi myole na bitsuhili bya paha bi byole bi byateleme ŋa busu bwa Pfumu a toto<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zak 4.3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11-14">11-14</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Tso muutu tondi ukwamisa bambangi ba me, mbaahu yiupala mu minywa mya bo na unyengese baboho ba bo. Eye, buuna ni bu Nzambi hamiivangimasa bikwilili bya wuuna wu tondi ukwamisa bo. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Bambangi mo baboole bali na lituma li ukaanda mvula, natee bu bo buumana uyabisa musamu a Nzambi. Bo bali kaka na matwala ma ukitusa mamba mu makila, na ubwahila toto mapasi ma pila mu pila, mu pasi taangu yi bo batondi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:19-20">Pal 7.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 4:8">1Sa 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17:1">1Pf 17.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Bu bo buumana uyabisa musamu a Nzambi, ibulu hya tsisu hi himiipala hutso a mbeenge ya doheselee, hyulwanisa bo, hyubiingala bo na hyuduba bo. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Buuyala bamvumbi ba bo mu luuha lilinene li musyenge wu munene, huuna hu baakomini Pfumu a bo. Mu uduukala matsimi ma baatu ba musyenge mo wuuna, mbiili a bo yaaba we yi musyenge a Sodoomo na tsi a Ngipiti. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Baatu ba mabuli moosi, bibandu byosi, mandaha moosi, matsi moosi, buukaamono bamvumbi ba bo mu bilumbu bitatu na itini. Na a buusiingasa ti badiiha bo ve. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Baatu ba ŋa toto buuba mu kinya na musaangu na usa mukungi mu umono bamvumbi mo baana. Bo baakatsindasana bungodu mu tooni ati, mimbihuli mo mya myole miniimi, myaanyongisi baatu ba ŋa toto.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ka hu mbisa bilumbu mo bibitatu na itini, muvumu wu ubaava moonyi amati huli Nzambi, akoti mu bo, na bo baatelimi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:5">Ezk 37.5</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 37:10">10</ref></char></note>, na boosi ba baamoni bo, baamoni tsisu yindahi. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Mimbihuli mo mi myole, myayuhi ndaha mosi yi mifudi hu mayulu yi yaakatuma bo: «Vataani huni!» Bo baavati hutso a yidu, ŋa busu bu baboho ba bo. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Mu taangu mo yiina, toto yanyingimi mu mifudi. Ikuuku imosi mu kuumi li bikuuku hi musyenge hyatsamuhi. Biveeve tsambu (7 000) bya baatu byanyambihini mu tooni a toto yi yanyingimi. Baatu bakima baamoni tsisu yindahi, na baayusi Nzambi a hu mayulu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Lingebe la moole limiivyoho. Ka kebaani! Lingebe li mutatu laaka bebele mu uya.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pofi wu mutsambu li mu ufula kulambeete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Buuna, pofi wu mutsambu afuli kulambeete. Mandaha ma mifudi maayuhini hu mayulu na maakaleele: «Lituma la toto limiivyoho ŋa myoho mya Pfumu a bisu na huli Masiya ma nde. Lituma mo liina luuba mu bilima na bilima!» <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Mikukunyungu maku moole mina mi myaba myatsahala mu makiti ma bo ma ipfumu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, myakongimini, myakuundi Nzambi <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />na ubaaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">«Pfumu Nzambi Pungu matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">we wu li, na wu aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">bisu limiifutala matondo huli we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">bu we salili matwala ma we ma manene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">na mu utsahisa Ipfumu hya we.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Mabuli ma baatu beedi maamiiteleme na kesi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ka bunuubu ni kesi a we yimiimonehele,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">napa taangu yi utsundasa babaakwa yimiito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">yi usyende basalili ba we, mimbihuli,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">baatu ba ngidi na boosi ba bali mu ukiinza nduhi a we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">tso bali baatu ba baanyanza, tso baatu ba likiinzu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">na uduba ba bali mu ubiyasa toto!»<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Mbuha a ngidi ya Nzambi ya hu mayulu yaadibumi, na kasu a nzuhisini yaamonihili. Mivedi-a-vedi myamwedimi, kele mandaha yaayuhini, banzyedi baabaandi, toto yanyingimi na mvula mamanya wu mifudi anohi.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mukaasu na ibulu hya kimuhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Iliimbu hiinene hyamonihili hu mayulu: mukaasu mumosi alwata taangu we ikutu. Tsuungi aba hu tsina a miilu mya nde, na mutata nga bamvwelele kuumi na boole ŋa yulu mutswe a nde. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Nde aba na yimi, na nde akafulaha mu pasi mibaandu mi misoongo.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Iliimbu ikima hyamonihili hu mayulu: ibulu hya nduhi a Darango<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ibulu hya nduhi a Darango </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili peleve na mapapi hi hibaayene mu miilu mina we ngaandu.</char></note>, hi libengu la mbaahu, hyaba na mitswe tsambu na matsyembo kuumi. Na ŋa yulu a pasi mutswe hwaba na mutata. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mu mukila a nde, nde adutihi kabu limosi mu makabu matatu hi litangu li bamvwelele baa hu yulu, na nde abwisi bo ŋa toto. Ibulu hya kimuhili hiinene hi hili na mapapi, hyatelimi ŋa busu bu mukaasu wu aba bebele na ubuta, mana hyo hydya mwaana wu nde huubuta. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Mukaasu abuti mwaana wa bahala, wu utuma matsi moosi na likaanda li itali<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:7">Esa 66.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:9">Mkg 2.9</ref></char></note> mu myoho. Mawasa-mawasa, Nzambi amaasi mwaana, asuusi nde ŋa pedu a nde na ŋa pedu a kiti-ipfumu hya nde. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Na mukaasu abati hu kumu a nzala, hu Nzambi haba hamiivangila nde mbuha. Mana abuungala nde mu iveeve imosi makama moole na maku masamunu (1 260) ma bilumbu.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Buuna, mudiingu abwiidi hu mayulu. Mikayeli na bapofi ba nde, baalwanisi ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi. Ibulu hya kimuhili na bapofi ba nde baalwani. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ka Mikayeli na bapofi ba nde baabiingili ibulu. Na ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi, na bapofi ba nde a baabwebaha mbuha hu yulu ve. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Baatsindihili ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi hiinene hu mbadi, hyo hili taadi a tsomi, nga nduhi mukuyi na Saatana, wu ubaasoho baatu ba toto yoosi. Baabwisi nde hu toto, na bapofi ba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1">Mba 3.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Buuna, me anzuhi ndaha mosi yi mifudi hu yulu yi yaakaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">«Yiniiyi ka ni taangu liyobolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">taangu yi Nzambi a bisu huumweese matwala ma nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">na Ipfumu hya nde.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Tangu mo yiniiyi, lituma lika mu myoho mya Masiya ma nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">mu tooni ati, bamiibwaha mukesi a bana baa ngu ba bisu hu mbadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">nde ni wu akakese bo nyangu na butsuhu ŋa busu bwa Nzambi a bisu.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Ka baana ba ngu ba bisu baabiingili nde,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">mu makila ma Mwana Limeme,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">na mu mambu ma bo baatiili imbangi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Bo baayehuli idiingu hya bo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">natee mu usiinga lipfu.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ni mu buuna, baani mu kinya! Mayulu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">na benu boosi ba lili mu utsahala huuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">ni lingebe huli benu, toto na mubu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Mu tooni ati, mukuyi amiikulamana huli benu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">na kesi yi mifudi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">bu nde ayabi ti, taangu ndulu hole yimiisaala nde.»<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ŋa ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi hyamoni ti bamiitsindahala nde hu toto, nde abaandihi ubingasa mukaasu wu abuti mwaana wa bahala. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Buuna, baaviidi mapapi moole ma mbida wu munene huli mukaasu, mu udumaha natee hu mbuha yi baaba baamiivangila nde hu kumu a nzala, lala na taadi. Mana babuungala nde huuna, mu bilima bitatu na batsungi basamunu. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Taadi aluhi mamba we nzali wu munene hu mbisa mukaasu, mana nyamba yibita nde. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ka toto yakumbisi mukaasu. Yo yadibumi na yamini nzali wu ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi hyapalisi mu munywa a nde. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Bu nde haluli mu kesi mu mukaasu mo wuuna, ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi, hyayalwanisa baa imbisa hi mukaasu bakima ba basaali. Bo ba bali mu ukeelese mikele mya Nzambi na ba baakangama mu imbuli hi Yisu ali mu uyabisa. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Na ibulu hya kimuhili hi hili na mapapi, hyatelimi ŋa muvanga mubu.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Ibulu hi hili mu upala mu mubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Titswene, me amoni ibulu imosi hyapali mu mubu. Hi hyaba na matsyembo kuumi, na mitswe tsambu na mutata ŋa yulu a pasi tsyembo, ŋa yulu mitswe mya nde, baasonehe manduhi ma utuha Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Ibulu hi me amoni, hyaba we ngo, miilu mya nde myaba we mya imbungu na munywa a nde we wa kosi. Ibulu hya nduhi a Darango hyaviidi nde matwala ma nde, kiti-ipfumu hya nde na lituma la nde li linene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:3-6">Dan 7.3-6</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Mutswe mumosi ŋa hati li mitswe mi Ibulu, aba we wu amiisumbaha mu iteesi hi lipfu, ka libuma la nde laabeeluhi. Toto yoosi yaakoti hutso a kimuhili, na yaaduukili Ibulu. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Baatu baakongimini ŋa busu bwa Darango. Mu tooni ati, nde aviidi lituma huli Ibulu. Bo baakongimini kaka ŋa busu bu Ibulu na ubaalele: «Na afwanina na Ibulu? Na utwala ulwanisa hyo?»<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Baaviidi Ibulu lituma li ubaapalisa mambu ma isaayi, na bituhi. Na hyo hyabahi kaka lituma li ubaavanga moosi ma litondo la nde, mu batsungi maku mana na boole. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Nde abaandihi mu ubaatuha Nzambi, mu ubaatuha nduhi a Nzambi na ngooto a ngidi a nde, napa boosi ba bubaatsahala hu yulu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Nde ayaki lituma li ulwanisa buli la baatu ba Nzambi na ubiingala lo. Nde abahi lituma ŋa yulu bibandu byosi, pasi buli, pasi ndaha na pasi tsi. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Baatu ba ŋa toto boosi buukongemene nde. Ni bo baana umata mbandihili a tsi, baa manduhi baavelesonehe mu libuuku la moonyi la Mwana Limeme wu baadubi.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Nyaha nga matswi ayuha!<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Tso muutu afwana uba ikondaayi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">nde sa akoto kondaayi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Muutu wu afwana ukwa mu sabila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">nde sa akwa mu sabila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 13:10">Ni mu buuna, baa ibaandu hya Nzambi baafwana umweese mukonono na imiinu.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibulu hi hili mu upala mu toto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Titswene me ambwemono ibulu ikima hi hyakapala hutso a toto. Hyo hyaba na matsyembo moole ma we ma Mwana Limeme, ka hyo hyakatoyo we Darango. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Hyo hyakasalila lituma loosi li ibulu hyatsomi, hi hyapali mu mamba. Ibulu mo hya byole, hyakatuma baatu ba toto mu ukongemene ŋa busu bu Ibulu hyatsomi, hi baabelusi libuma la pasi. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ibulu mo hya byole hyakasa bipadi bya kimuhili. Hyo hyakakulamasa mbaahu umata hu mayulu natee ŋa toto ŋa miisu ma baatu boosi. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Hyo hyakadungasa baatu ba ŋa toto mu biliimbu bya kimuhili, bi baaviidi nde lituma mu usa ŋa busu bu ibulu hyatsomi. Hyo hyakasimbala baatu mu uvanga ifwita, mu muyusu a ibulu hi hyanemini mu sabila, ka hyo hyabwefutaha moonyi. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Ibulu hya byole hyayaki lituma li uva moonyi huli ifwita hi Ibulu hyatsomi, mana ifwita mo hiina hitwala utoyo na utuma uduba boosi ba buuvelekongemene hyo. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ibulu hyakasimbala baatu boosi, bangebe na bakuutu, bisina na biyaha, baviha na ba bali bunyanga, mu usiinga uyaka iliimbu ŋa kaka la mbahala buuve ŋa libunzu. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Muutu utwala usumba tso usumbasa pasi isiha tso nde a hali na iliimbu mo hiina ve. Iliimbu mo ni nduhi ibulu, buuve litangu li bisono bi byayelemene na nduhi mo yiina. <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Hwafwana uba na tsiki. Muutu nga buyedi utwala ubaangula lisuunga li litangu li Ibulu. Mu tooni ati, litangu mo laayelemene na nduhi a muutu. Litangu la nde, ni makama masamunu maku masamunu na bisamunu (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Dyimbu la baatu ba baayobili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Me ambwetala: me amoni Mwana Limeme aba ateleme ŋa yulu isyelo hya Syoni. Itwadi na nde, hwaba biveeve kama maku mana na bina (144 000) bya baatu, ba baaba baasonehe nduhi a Limeme, na ya Taata a nde mu libunzu la bo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Me anzuhi ndaha mosi yi yaakamata hu yulu, yaakapala we puba a mamba yinene na we idumu hi mifudi hya nzyedi. Na munyingu wu me anzuhi, aba we munyingu mi mingongo mi baatu bali mu usiha. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Biveeve mo bya baatu byakayimba dyimbu li linyatihi ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu, ŋa busu bu bivaangu bya moonyi bibina na ŋa busu bu mikukunyungu. Muutu tso mumosi a hakitwala uyiha dyimbu mo liina ve, ndulu ni biveeve kama maku mana na bina (144 000) bya baatu ba Nzambi haayobili ŋa toto.<verse eid="REV 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Bo a baasumini nyutu abo mu upala na bakaasu ve, ka bo baakeelisi bungidi. Bo bali mu uduukala Mwana Limeme pasi hu nde ali mu uyene. Nzambi ayobili bo ŋa hati la baatu ba tsi, mana bo baba baatu baatsomi baa buuyeholo huli Nzambi na huli Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Mu minywa mya bo, a hu li na mambu ma upfuta ve. Bo a bali na dyaambu li buutwala usyembe bo ve.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bapofi babatatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Titswene, me ambwemono pofi mukima wu akadumaha hu hati a yulu. Nde aba na Musamu wu Mubwe wu bilima na bilima wu uyabisa huli baatu ba ŋa toto, huli baatu ba matsi moosi, huli baatu ba bibandu byosi, baa mandaha moosi na baa mabuli moosi. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Nde akaleele mu ndaha yi mifudi: «Kiinzaani Nzambi na vaani nde muyusu, mu tooni ati taangu a tsundusu a baatu yimiito. Kongemenaani ŋa busu bwa wu avanga yulu, toto, mubu, na mitswe mi banzali!»<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Pofi mukima waboole, ayaduukala watsomi na uleele: «Nde miibwa, nde miibwa, musyenge wu munene: Babylooni! Nde anywisi mabuli moosi vinye yi bunuumba bwa nde bu bwafulala!»<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Pofi mukima, wu mutatu wu aduukili bapofi boole batsomi akaleele mu ndaha yi mifudi: «Tso muutu kongimini ŋa busu bu ibulu na ifwita hya nde, na tso nde yaki iliimbu ŋa libunzu buuve ŋa kaka, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />nde unywa kaka vinye a kesi ya Nzambi. Yo ni vinye yi baavelesoho na iloho ikima, na Nzambi usyeholo yo mutso a mbungu a nde ya kesi. Boosi ba buusa buuna, buunyongese bo hutso a mbaahu a suufe ŋa busu bu bapofi bangidi na ŋa busu bwa Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Mwiki a mbaahu wu li mu unyongese bo, ukaakumasa mu bilima na bilima. Butsuhu na nyangu, ba bali mu ukongemene ŋa busu bu Ibulu na ŋa busu bu ifwita, a bali mu uvuma ve. Na pasi muutu wu li mu uyaka iliimbu hya nduhi a nde kaka a hali mu uvuma ve.» <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ni mu buuna, yiniiyi ka ni taangu yi mukonono huli baatu ba Nzambi, ba bali mu ukeelese matumili ma nde, na ba bali mu usa imiinu mu Yisu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Titswene me anzuhi ndaha mosi hu mayulu yakaleele me: «Sonehe mambu mo maniima: “Kinya yili huli ba bali mu ukwa mu tooni isalu hya Pfumu, mu taangu mo yiniiyi!” Livupu lileeli ti: “Eye, bo buuvuma hu mbisa bisalu bya bo bi binono, mu tooni ati mavaanga ma bo ma mabwe mali mu uduukala bo!”»<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsonzihili mihunu mya toto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Me amoni yidu li lifuuka. Na ŋa yulu a yidu hwaba hwatsahala wu afwanina na mwaana a muutu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note>. Nde aba alwata mutata wa mu wolo mu mutswe a nde. Na nde aba akaanga ŋa hooho, mukwati wu ato. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Pofi mukima apali mu nzo a Nzambi. Nde akafulaha mu mifudi huli wu aba atsahala ŋa yulu a yidu na ubaaleele: «Volo mukwati a we na kese mihunu. Yiniiyi ka ni taangu yi utsonzehe mu tooni ati, mihunu mya toto mimiiyele!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 4:13">Yoe 4.13</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu aba atsahala ŋa yulu a yidu, avoli mukwati a nde, na akesi mihunu mya toto.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Pofi mukima apali mu nzo a Nzambi yi yili hu yulu. Nde kaka aba akaanga mukwati wu ato.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Pofi mukima kaka wu aba na matwala ma utuma mbaahu, apali hutso a diiku li bubaatsuha bungodu. Mu mifudi myosi, nde aleeli huli pofi wu aba akaanga mukwati wu ato: «Volo mukwati a we wu ato, na kese bisaka bya mbutu a vinye ya toto. Mu tooni ati, mbutu a vinye yaamiiyele.» <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Pofi avoli mukwati a nde wu ato, na nde atsonzihi mbutu a vinye ya toto. Nde abwahi mbutu hutso inyihili hinene hya kesi a Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Baanyihi mbutu a vinye hutso inyihili hu mbadi musyenge. Makila ma maapali mu inyihili, maatoodi natee mu mutaabu munywa a buuru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mutaabu munywa a buuru </char><char style="ft" closed="false">afwanina na mutaabu mapapanga ma muutu wu li mu tele.</char></note>. Makila mo maapuhimi mu iteesi hi bakilometere makama matatu (300)<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:1-6">Esa 63.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 1:15">Min 1.15</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Bapofi na mapasi ma tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Titswene, me amoni hu yulu, iliimbu ikima hiinene na hya kimuhili, bapofi tsambu baaba baakaanga mapasi tsambu. Maana ni mapasi ma tsyelele, mu tooni ati, ni mu mo kesi a Nzambi ya tsukusu yi umonehele.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Na me amoni mubu wu akamonehele yanga-yanga we mulingu wu apfuutana na mbaahu. Boosi ba baabiingili ibulu, ifwita hya nde na litangu li laayelemene na nduhi a nde, baaba baateleme ŋa yulu mubu wa yalalaa wuuna. Pasi muutu mu bo aba akaanga mingongo mya Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Bo bali mu uyimba dyimbu la Moose, musalili a Nzambi, na dyimbu la Mwana Limeme:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">«Pfumu Nzambi Pungu Matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">mavaanga ma we mali ma manene na ma kimuhili!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">We li Pfumu a mabuli moosi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">manzila ma we mali ma tsiitsa na ma mbuli!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Pfumu, na uyehele uvelekiinza we?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Na ubisa uva we muyusu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Mu tooni ati, ndulu we li wa ngidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">baatu boosi buuyaakongemene we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">mu tooni ati, butsiitsa bwa we bumiimonehele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 10:7">Yel 10.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:9">Mkg 86.9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Hu mbisa a maana, me amoni hu mayulu mbuha a ngidi, ngooto a ngidi ya nzuhisini a Nzambi, yaadibumi. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Bapofi batsambu ba baaba baakaanga mapasi matsambu, baapali hu mbadi a mbuha a ngidi. Bo baaba baalwata bikutu bya lino, bi lifuuku li libaamwedeme. Bo baaba na midi mya mu wolo mu luungu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ivangu hya moonyi imosi ŋa hati li bivaangu bya moonyi bibina, hyaviidi huli bapofi batsambu, bikoombe tsambu bya mu wolo bi byaluula mu kesi a Nzambi, wu li moonyi mu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Mbuha a ngidi yaaluuli mu mwiki, mu tooni muyusu na matwala ma Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Pal 40.34-35</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:10-11">1Pf 8.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 6:4">Esa 6.4</ref></char></note>. Muutu tso mumosi aba utwala ukoto hu mbuha a ngidi ve, tswaamina mapasi matsambu ma bapofi batsambu mafwa.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Bikoombe bitsambu bya kesi a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Titswene, me anzuhi ndaha mosi yi mifudi yaakamata hu tsyelo a mbuha a ngidi na yaakaleele huli bapofi batsambu: «Yenaani, yapuhaani bikoombe bitsambu bya kesi a Nzambi hu toto!»<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Pofi watsomi ayeni, apuhi ikoombe hya nde mu toto. Buuna, mambaadi ma mabi ma na mibaandu maabwidi ŋa yulu a baatu ba baaba na biliimbu bi Ibulu. Bo baana ba baakakongemene ifwita hya nde. <verse eid="REV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Pofi waboole apuhi ikoombe hya nde mu mubu. Mamba ma mubu maakituhi makila we makila ma mvumbi, na bivaangu bya moonyi byosi bi byaba mu mubu byakwidi.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Pofi wu mutatu apuhi ikoombe hya nde mu banzali na mitswe mi banzali; na byo byakituhi makila<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:17-21">Pal 7.17-21</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Na me anzuhi pofi nga lituma ŋa yulu a mamba mu uleele: «We li wa Ngidi, we wu li na wu aba, we, wa Ngidi, mu tooni ati we miisalila butsiitsa bwa we. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ka bo baapuhi makila ma baatu ba Nzambi na ma mimbihuli. Na we miiva bo makila ma unywa; buuna byafwana mu bo.» <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Titswene, me anzuhi diiku la tsuhili bungodu mu uleele: «Eye, Pfumu Nzambi, Pungu matwala, matsundusu ma we mali ma mbuli na maatsiitsa!»<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Pofi wu muna apuhi ikoombe hya nde ŋa yulu a taangu. Baaviidi nde muswa wu utsuha baatu mu mbaahu a yo, <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />na baatu baanyengi mu ibabudu hi hyafulala. Bo baatuhi nduhi a Nzambi wu li na matwala ŋa yulu mapasi mo maana. Ka bo a baasobi mbiili a bo mu uva nde muyusu ve.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Pofi wu mutaanu apuhi ikoombe hya nde ŋa yulu a kiti-ipfumu hi Ibulu, na ipfumu hya nde hyakoti hutso a piipidi. Baatu baakakaha malimi mu tooni munyongi. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Bo baatuhi Nzambi a hu mayulu mu tooni minyongi mya bo na mambaadi ma bo. Ka bo a baasobi mavaanga ma bo ma mabi ve.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Pofi wu musamunu apuhi ikoombe hya nde mu nzali wu munene nga nduhi Efate. Nzali akanyi mu uvangimasa nzila batumi ba bali mu umata hu tsyelo yi taangu yibaapala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:15">Esa 11.15</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Titswene, me amoni mavupu ma mabi matatu ma maakafwanina na makoto mu upala mu munywa a Darango, mu munywa Ibulu, na mu munywa a mumbihuli wu mapfuta. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Mo mali mavupu matengo ma mu baasa bipadi. Mo mali mu uyamono batumi baa toto yoosi, mu ukuukaha bo mu tooni mudiingu wu ilumbu hiinene hya Nzambi, Pungu Matwala.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />Pfumu ti: «Mono, me ndi mu unza we muyibi! Kinya huli wuuna wu li likanda na wu li mu ukeelese bikutu bya nde, mu uveledyenge pene na mu uvelemono tsonyi.»<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Mavupu maakuukihi batumi ŋa mbuha mosi yi bubaateele mu ndaha yi Ibeleho Aramangedo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:19">Bnz 5.19</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:29">2Pf 23.29</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Pofi wu mutsambu apuhi ikoombe hya nde ŋa yulu livupu. Ndaha mosi yi mifudi yaayuhini hu mbuha a ngidi. Yo yaakapala hu kiti-ipfumu na yaakaleele: «Bumiivangama!» <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Hwamonihili mivedi-a-vedi, kele mandaha, na bidumu bi banzyedi, nyingimini a toto yi mifudi yi yaavelemavangama umata pangili a muutu ŋa toto. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Musyenge wu munene akabuhi mu bitini bitatu, na misyenge mi matsi moosi myatsaamuhi. Na Nzambi ayibwili moonyi mu musyenge wu munene wa Babylooni. Nde aviidi nde ikoombe hya nde hya kesi yinono<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Esa 51.17</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Biliiŋa byosi byadimbili, na bisyelo a byabwemonehele ve. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mvula mamanya ma manene na ma maaleme, abwidi ŋa yulu a baatu. Baatu baatuhi Nzambi mu pasi a mvula mamanya. Mu tooni ati, aba pasi yinene.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Lilaala li linene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ni mu buuna, mumosi ŋa hati li bapofi batsambu ba baaba baakaanga bikoombe tsambu ayaleele me: «Yaanga, na me tsa mweese we tsundusu yi yubwila lilaala li linene, liina li laatsahala ŋa yulu banzali ba banene. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Batumi baa toto baakoti mu ndyatili yi bulaala na nde. Na baatu ba ŋa toto baalaangi malamu ma bulaala bwa nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:17">Esa 23.17</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:7">Yel 51.7</ref>,<ref loc="JER 51:13">13</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Livupu laakaangi me na pofi abiti me hu kumu a nzala. Huuna me amoni mukaasu mumosi wu atsahala ŋa yulu ibulu imosi hi ibeenge, hi hyaba hyaluula mu manduhi ma utuha Nzambi. Ibulu mo hyaba na mitswe tsambu na matsyembo kuumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Mukaasu aba alwata bikutu bi bibeenge bya talu. Nde aba alwata kaka bilengele bi bilahi bya mu wolo, bya mu mamanya ma talu na bya mu bilabu. Nde aba akaanga ŋa kaka, mbungu mosi ya mu wolo, yi yaaba yaaluula mu mavaanga ma nde ma nzododo na mu mbiili a nde yi mbi. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Mu libunzu la nde aba baasonehe nduhi mosi ya tswehi. Mbinduli ni ti: «Babylooni, musyenge wu munene, ngu a malaala, ngu a mavaanga ma nzododo ŋa toto.» <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Me amoni ti mukaasu mo wuuna aba alaanga makila ma baatu ba ngidi na makila ma bambangi baa Yisu. Bu me amoni nde, me akimuhi huulahi.<verse eid="REV 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Buuna pofi akaleele me: Mu hima we li mu ukimuha? Me tsa nzabisa we tswehi a mukaasu mo wunuwu, na ma ibulu hi hili mu ubaabita nde. Ibulu hi hili na mitswe tsambu na matsyembo kuumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Ibulu hi we amoni, hyaba moonyi hutsomi, ka bunuubu, hyo a hisaali moonyi ve. Hyo sa hipala hutso a mbeenge ya doheselee mu uyene hu unyambana. Baatu ba ŋa toto ba baavelesonehe manduhi mu libuuku la moonyi, umata pangili a toto, sa bakimuha ŋa bo buumono ibulu. Mu tooni ati, hyo hyaba moonyi hutsomi na hyo a hisaali moonyi ve. Ka hyo sa hibwemonehele.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Ŋaniiŋa, muutu afwana uba na buyedi na tsikihili. Mitswe mitsambu ni bisyelo tsambu bi mukaasu hatsahala ŋa yulu a byo. Myo kaka ni batumi tsambu. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Bataanu mu bo baamiibwa. Wu musamunu kini mu utuma buunuubu. Mutumi wu mutsambu kini a hamaya ve. Ka mu taangu yi nde huuya, nde sa adiinga ndulu mu mwaana taangu hole. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Ibulu hi hyaba moonyi hutsomi, na a hyasaala moonyi ve, hyo hili hyo mwakulu mutumi wu mupwombo. Ni hyo kaka hili mumosi mu batumi batsambu, na hyo hili mu uyene hu unyambana.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />«Matsyembo makuumi ma we amoni, mali batumi kuumi ba bakini a baabandihi utuma ve. Ka bo sa bayaka matwala ma utuma na ibulu mu ngunga mosi. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Bo boosi bakuumi bali na matsimi mamosi: usalila matwala na lituma bya bo hu tsina a tumili ibulu. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Bo sa balwanisa Mwana Limeme. Ka Mwana Limeme sa abiingala bo mu tooni ati, nde ni Pfumu bapfumu, na Mutumi batumi. Nde ubiingala itwadi na ba nde hateele na ba nde hasoolo, ba bali ngetetee mu nde.» <verse eid="REV 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Pofi aleeli me: «Mamba ma we moni maana, ŋa hwatsahala lilaala, ni mabuli, makonge, matsi na mandaha. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Matsyembo makuumi ma we moni maana na ibulu sa babelele lilaala. Bo sa bapatula lo bisiha byosi bi lo lili na byo na usiisa lo pene. Bo sa badya musunya a lilaala na utsuha lo loosi hu mbaahu. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Mu tooni ati, Nzambi asuusi mutso mitima mya bo litondo li utswihasa tsimi a nde. Bo sa bavanga buuna mu itwadi mu usuusa lituma li ipfumu hya bo hu tsina a tumili ibulu, natee bu mambu ma Nzambi mu utswiha.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Buuna, mukaasu wu we amoni wuuna ni musyenge wu munene wu li mu utuma batumi baa toto.»<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Babylooni yimiibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Titswene, me amoni pofi mukima mu ukulamana ŋa toto umata hu yulu. Nde aba na lituma li linene, na muyusu a nde ayalusi toto yoosi. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Nde afulihi mu mifudi: «Nde miibwa, nde miibwa, musyenge wu munene wa Babylooni! Mu taangu mo yiniiyi, yi ka ndulu mbuha yi matengo mu ukaatsahala, iswemili hi mavupu ma mabi ma pila mu pila. Iswemili hi banyunyi na bibulu byosi bi byasumaha na bi bibi. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Mabuli moosi maanywidi malamu ma bunuumba bwa nde bu mifudi. Mu tooni ati, bapfumu ba toto baamiikoto hutso bunuumba na nde, na basumbisi baa mumbungu ŋa toto baamiibaha busina bu bulahi mu bunene bu busina bwa nde.»<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Titswene, me anzuhi ndaha kima yi yaamati hu mayulu na yaakaleele: «Benu buli la me, palaani mu musyenge mo wunuuwu, mana liveleba likoongo mu masumu ma nde. Na liveleyaka itwadi na nde, mapasi ma muubwila nde. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Mu tooni ati, masumu ma nde maamiiluula natee hu yulu. Na Nzambi a havusana mavaanga ma tsonyi maana ve. <verse eid="REV 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Futaani nde we bu nde hafuti bana. Futalaani nde pfutala yoole yi mavaanga ma mabi ma nde havangi. Lusaani mbungu a nde mu malamu ma maavyohelele mifudi pyoho yoole. We bu nde haakanywisa baatu bana. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Mwesaani nde munyongi na lingebe li lilahi we bu nde haakatondo muyusu na busina. Kotesaani nde hutso lingebe li lafwana. Nde li mu uleele hutso mutima a nde: “Ŋaniiŋa, me ndi mutumi wu mukaasu. Me a handi mukwili ve, na me a hukwisa muutu tso mumosi ve.” <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ni mu buuna, mapasi mo maniima moosi muubwila nde ilumbu imosi: lipfu, lingebe na nzala. Mbaahu sa yinyengese nde. Ka Pfumu Nzambi wu atsundasa nde, li na matwala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:7-9">Esa 47.7-9</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Batumi baa ŋa toto ba baasiidi bumbembo na makinya ma busina na nde, sa balila na unyongo mu tooni a nde. Ŋa bo buutalila mwiiki a musyenge wu bamiitsuha. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Bo sa batahuha mwaana a lala, mu tooni a boomo bu munyongi a nde, na bo sa baleele: «Lingebe! Ki pila lingebe! O Babylooni, musyenge wu munene na wu matwala! Mu ngunga ndulu mosi, we miibaha tsyembili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16-17">Ezk 26.16-17</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Baatu banga mumbungu ŋa toto kaka bali mu ulila na bali mu lingebe mu tooni a musyenge mo wuuna. Mu tooni ati, muutu tso mumosi a habwesumba fwanda a bo ve: <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />wolo, itali hi hyafuuka, mamanya ma talu, bilabu, matsaanda ma mu liino, matsaanda ma talu ma mabeenge, swa. Miti mya pila mu pila mya pasi mu ubaha, bisiha bya pila mu pila, bya mu mapungi ma banzahu, bya mu mabaya ma talu, bya mu itali hi hyabeenge, bya mu itali, buuve bya mu mamanya ma mabwe ma baasyenge. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Bisuungu bi miti, na bisiha bikima bya tsulu yimbwe mu byudya, nyafi, miire na paha a tsulu yimbwe, malamu, maadi, farine na masangu. Bangombe na mandombo, babuuru, matomo ma babuuru, baviha na bikondaayi. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bo bali mu uleele: «Yuha ti, bisiha byosi bi we aba na byo nzala, byamiidimbala hu bwa we. Busina na bubwe bwa we bi miidimbala. Na a buukabwemono byo ve.» <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Banga mumbungu ba baabaha busina mu tooni mumbungu mutso musyenge mo wunuwu, sa batahuha lala, mu boomo bu munyongi a nde. Bo sa balila na uyayana. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Bo sa baleele: «Lingebe! Ki pila lingebe mu musyenge wu munene! Nde beedi baalwatisa tsanda ya liino, na matsanda ma talu ma mabeenge. Nde beedi aluula mu bilengele bya mu wolo, mamanya ma talu, na bilabu. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Na mu ngunga mosi ndulu, busina bwosi bwadimbili!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Babiti boosi ba makuumbi, na badyengi boosi ba bali mutso a mo, ba bali mu usala na bo, boosi ba bali mu usa bisalu hu mubu, baatahuhi lala. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Na bo baakafulaha ŋa bo baatalili mwiki a mbaahu yi yaakanyengese musyenge: « A hwaba na musyenge tso mumosi wu munene we nde wunuuwu ve!» <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Bo baakabwahasana mufundu hu yulu mitswe na baakalila. Bo baakayayana na baakafulaha: «Lingebe! Ki pila lingebe mu musyenge wu munene! Ni mu busina bwa nde baatu boosi banga makuumbi ŋa yulu mubu baakabaha busina. Ka mu ngunga mosi ndulu, byosi bi miidimbala!»<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Yulu, baa mu kinya mu tooni a musyenge wu miibwa! Baani mu kinya benu baatu ba ibaandu hya Nzambi, biluumbi na mimbihuli! Mu tooni ati, Nzambi miitsundasa musyenge mu bubi bu nde havangila benu. <verse eid="REV 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Titswene, pofi mumosi nga matwala avoli manya limosi li laaleme la we inyihili hya mbutu a bele, abwahi lo hutso mubu na aleeli: «Ni bunuubu, bubwisa musyenge wu munene wa Babylooni mu mifudi, na a bubwemono nde ve. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />A bubweyuha huli we, munyingu a mingongo na munyingu wu bayimbi ve. A bubweyuha munyingu wu basihi baa lileeso buuve wu bafuli baa kulambeete ve. A bubwemono basali ba mu myoho tso mumosi ve. A buubweyuha kele inyihili hya mbutu a bele ve. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Liyalala la mwinda a luubwemwedeme huli we ve. A buubweyuha ndaha mulumi na yi mukadi ba bamiikwelene ve. Banga mumbungu beedi baalutahala biita mu toto yoosi. Na mu tooni a tsalili a we yi bungaanga, we miidungasa mabuli moosi.» <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Hu Babylooni baatsolisi makila ma mimbihuli na ma baatu ba ibaandu hya Nzambi. Makila ma baatu boosi ba baadubi ŋa toto, maatsoli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 51:49">Yel 51.49</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Dyimbu li muyusu a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Humbisa a mambu mo maana, me anzuhi hu mayulu, ndaha yi mifudi, we ya konge a baatu. Yo yaakaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">«Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Liyobolo, muyusu na matwala bili bya Nzambi a bisu!<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Matsundusu ma nde mali ma mbuli na ma butsiitsa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Nde asyembi lilaala li linene</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">li laakayuya baatu ba toto mu bumbembo bwa lo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Nzambi miikambisa nde makila ma basalili ba nde baa hoho hwa nde hwadubi.»<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Bo baabweleele: «Haleluya! Mwiki a musyenge wu munene wu baatsuhi, li muukumasa mu bilima na bilima!»<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Mikukunyungu maku moole mina mo, na bivaangu bya moonyi bibina, baakongimini na baakuundi Nzambi wu li mu utuma ŋa kiti-ipfumu. Bo baaleeli: «Amen! Haleluya!»<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukungi makweele ma Mwana Limeme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ndaha yapali ŋa kiti-ipfumu. Yo yaakaleele: «Yimbalaani Nzambi a bisu, benu basalili ba nde boosi. Benu baa lili na boomo bwa nde, bakuutu we bangebe!» <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Titswene, me anzuhi ndaha yinene we ya konge a baatu. Yo yaaba we mapuba ma banzali, we bidumu bi banzyedi bi mifudi. Yo yaakaleele:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">«Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">Mu tooni ati, Pfumu Nzambi a bisu Pungu matwala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">amiivangimasa ipfumu hya nde!<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Libaani mu kinya na lifulalaani mu musaangu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">livaani nde muyusu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Mu tooni ati, taangu mukungi a makweele ma Mwana Limeme yimiito,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">nuumba a nde makweele amiivangama!<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Baatumi nde mu ulwata ikutu hya liino hya talu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:8">hi hibaamwedeme na hi hyatsyeme.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:8">Tsanda a liino ya talu yiina ni mavaanga ma tsiitsa ma baatu ba Nzambi.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Pofi aleeli me: «Sonehe: kinya yili na ba baateele hu mukungi makweele ma Mwana Limeme!» Nde ni ubweleele: «Maniima mali mambu ma mbuli ma Nzambi nde mwakulu amiileele.»<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Buuna, me atsokimi ŋa miilu mya nde mu ukuunda nde. Ka nde aleeli me: «A sa buuna ve! Me musalili we we me ndi, we baana ba ngu a we ba bali ngetetee mu imbuli hi Yisu hamweesi. Ni Nzambi ndulu we afwana ukuunda!» Ka imbuli hya Yisu bu himiimonehele, hyo hibaava matwala huli mimbihuli.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muutu ŋa yulu a buuru wu mufuuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Na me amoni yulu laadibuma, na buuru wu mufuuka amonihili ŋa busu bwa me. Wu aba ŋa yulu a nde nduhi a nde wa «ngetetee» na wa «mbuli». Nde ubaatsundasa na ubaalwana na butsiitsa. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Miisu ma nde mali mu ulula we ludi la mbaahu, ŋa yulu mutswe a nde hu li na mitata mi milahi. Nde li na nduhi yi baasonehe, yi ndulu nde mwakulu hayaaba. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Nde alwati iyunga hi hyayobohono makila. Nduhi a nde «Mukuma a Nzambi». <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Makonge ma balwani ma hu yulu maakabaduukala nde. Mo maaba ŋa yulu babuuru ba bafuuka na maaba maalwata bikutu bya talu bya liino, li lifuuka na li laatsyeme. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mu munywa a nde, hwakapala sabila a nduunga mu utete mabuli. Nde sa abita mabuli moosi na lituma li linono, na nde sa anyihula mbutu a vinye mu inyihuli hya kesi yi mifudi ya Nzambi Pungu matwala. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ŋa yulu iyunga hya nde mu masungimini ma ibelo, baaba baasonehe nduhi mo yiniiyi: «Mutumi batumi na Pfumu bapfumu». <verse eid="REV 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Titswene, me amoni pofi ateleme hutso a taangu. Nde afulihi mu ndaha yi mifudi huli banyunyi boosi ba baakadyengele hu hati a yulu: «Yaani, kuukamaani mu tooni mukungi wu munene wu udya wa Nzambi! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Yadyaani musunya batumi, musunya bakuutu ba masadaadu, musunya a banga matwala, musunya babuuru na wu babiti ba bo. Musunya a baatu boosi ba bali bunyanga na ba bali baviha, bangebe na bakuutu.» <verse eid="REV 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Titswene, me amoni ibulu, batumi baa toto na makonge ma bo ma masadaadu, baakuukama mu ulwanisa wu atsahala ŋa yulu a buuru na konge a nde yi masadaadu. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Baakangi ibulu na mumbihuli wu mapfuta, wu asiidi biliimbu bya kimuhili mu nduhi ibulu, mu udungasa ba baayaki iliimbu hi ibulu, ba baakakongemene ifwita hya nde. Baabwahi bo baboole baa moonyi, hutso a dyanga la mbaahu a suufe. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Masadaadu ma maasaali baadubi mo mu sabila wu li mu upala mu munywa a wu anama ŋa yulu a buuru, na banyunyi boosi baaywati bu baadiidi misunya mya bo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Kondaayi a Saatana mu iveeve hi bilima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Titswene, me amoni pofi mumosi mu ukulamana umata hu yulu. Nde aba akaanga tsaafi a mbeenge ya doheselee ŋa kaka na paanga yinene. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Nde akaangi Darango, taadi wu mukulu, nga nduhi mukuyi na Saatana, na nde ahadi nde mu iveeve hi bilima. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Pofi abwaahi nde hutso a mbeenge ya doheselee. Titswene, nde adibuhi yo mu tsaafi, na nde anyemi bwiingu ŋa yulu, mana Darango aveledungasa mabuli, natee bu iveeve hi bilima hyuvyoho. Hu mbisa iveeve hi bilima, baafwana unyangula Darango mu mwaana a taangu hoole. <verse eid="REV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Titswene, me amoni makiti ma ipfumu: ba baaba baatsahala ŋa yulu a mo, baayaki lituma li utsundasa. Me amoni kaka mivumu mya ba baadubi mu tooni imbangi hya bo mu Yisu na mu mambu ma Nzambi. Bo a baakundi ibulu ve, tso ifwita hya nde ve. A baakumi bo iliimbu ŋa libunzu tso ŋa kaka ve. Bo baabwefutaha moonyi na baabwetuma na Kristo mu iveeve hi bilima. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Baatu bakima ba baakwidi a baabwebaha moonyi ve, tehele iveeve hi bilima hifwa. Yiina ni tsuuhili yatsomi ya babaakwa. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Kinya huli ba bali mu ukoto mu tsuuhili yatsomi ya babaakwa! Bo bali bangidi, na lipfu la moole a lili na lituma ŋa yulu a bo ve. Ka bo sa baba bangaanga ba Nzambi baa bukaasalila Nzambi na Kristo. Na bo sa batuma na Kristo mu iveeve hi bilima.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mudiingu a tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Bu iveeve hi bilima hyufwa, sa banyahula Saatana mu kondaayi. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Nde sa apala mu udungasa matsi ma mali mu Gog na Magog<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gog na Magog</char><char style="ft" closed="false">umata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 38:1-23">Ezk 38.1-23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39">39</ref></char> ni buuna buukateele matsi ma mali iboho na buli la Nzambi mu tsukusu a taangu.</char></note>, ni ti bituungu bibina bya ŋa toto, mana bakuukaha bo mu mudiingu. Matsi mo sa malaha we musyeŋunyu mu muvanga a mubu. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Bo baatelimi mu toto yoosi, baadiingi itsaka hi hyaba baatu ba Nzambi na musyenge wu Nzambi hatondo. Ka mbaahu yaakulimini umata hu yulu na yaakudisi bo. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na mukuyi wu akapfuta bo, sa baabwaha nde hutso a dyanga la mbaahu a suufe, hu hwamiitswamina ibulu na mumbihuli wu mapfuta. Huuna sa banyongese bo nyangu na butsuhu, mu bilima na bilima.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsundusu ya tsyelele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Titswene, me amoni kiti-ipfumu yinene yi fuuka, na wu aba atsahala ŋa yulu a yo. Toto na mayulu byatahuhi lala na hiinzi hya nde, na a baabwemono byo ve. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Titswene, me amoni babaakwa, bakuutu na bangebe, baateleme ŋa busu bwa kiti-ipfumu. Baadibuli mabuuku. Baabwedibula libuuku likima, ni libuuku la moonyi. Baatsundisi babaakwa mu mavaanga ma bo baasiidi, we bu baasonehe mutso mabuuku<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:9-10">Dan 7.9-10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Mubu apalisi bamvumbi ba nde haaba na bo. Lipfu na tsi a babaakwa, bo kaka baapalisi babaakwa ba bo. Na baatsundisi bo boosi mu mavaanga ma bo baasiidi. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Lipfu na tsi a babaakwa baabwahi hutso a dyanga la mbaahu a suufe. Dyanga la mbaahu ni lipfu la moole. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Woosi wu baavelisonehe nduhi mu libuuku la moonyi, baabwahi nde hutso a dyanga la mbaahu.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yulu li linyatihi na toto yi nyatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Titswene, me amoni yulu li linyatihi na toto yi nyatihi. Yulu latsomi na toto yatsomi byadimbili, na mubu kaka adimbili. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Na me amoni musyenge a ngidi, Yeruselemi yi nyatihi mu ukulamana, umata hu yulu huli Nzambi. Nde amiivangama we mukadi wu amiilwata bubwe mu tooni mulumi a nde. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Me anzuhi ndaha yi mifudi yi yaakamata hu kiti-ipfumu na yaakaleele: «Bunuubu, ngooto a ngidi ya Nzambi yika ŋa hati la baatu. Nde sa akwilala na bo, na bo sa baba mabuli ma nde, Nzambi nde mwakulu sa aba na bo. Nde sa aba Nzambi a bo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Nde sa akombolo matsanga mu miisu ma bo. Lipfu a luubweba ve, tso lingebe, tso bililu, tso mapasi, mu tooni ati misamu myatsomi mi miidimbala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:11-12">Lev 26.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 25:8">Esa 25.8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:10">35.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 52:1">52.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:17">65.17</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 65:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:22">66.22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ezk 37.27</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Muutu wu aba atsahala ŋa kiti-ipfumu aleeli: «Bunuubu me ndi mu utsa bisiha byosi bi binyatihi.» Titswene nde aleeli me: «Sonehe maniima, mu tooni ati mambu ma me mali mambuli na ma usiila hiitu.» <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Nde aleeli me: «Bumiitswiha! Me ni <char style="tl">Alafa na Omenga</char> mbandihili na tsukusu. Wu li na peyu a mamba, me tsa pa nde mamba ma bungodu, ma mutswe a nzali wu ubaava moonyi. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Pasi muutu wu ubiinga, uyaka mukobe mo wuuna huli me. Me umba Nzambi a nde, na nde uba mwaana a me. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ka huli ba baavele na ibahala, ba baavele na imiinu, bipumbulu, badubi, malaala, banga bungaanga, basambili ba binzanzambi na boosi banga mapfuta, la bo kabu sa liba hutso a dyanga la mbaahu li lili mu ululaha na la suufe: liina ni lipfu la moole.»<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeruselemi yi nyatihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Titswene, mumosi mu bapofi batsambu, ba baaba baakaanga mambungu matsambu ma maaba maaluula mu mapasi tsambu ma tsyelele, ayaleele me: «Yaanga, me tsa mweese we mukadi wu Mwana Limeme amiikwele.»<verse eid="REV 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Pofi abiti me mu matwala ma Livupu ŋa yulu isyelo hiinene hi mutaabu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:2">Ezk 40.2</ref></char></note>. Na nde amweesi me musyenge a ngidi. Yeruselemi, wu aba mu ukulamana umata hu yulu huli Nzambi. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Yeruselemi yaakamwedeme mu muyusu a Nzambi. Liyalala la yo laaba we manya la talu. Manya la zape li mayangala we manya li mulingu. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Yo yaaba na ibaha hiinene na hi mutaabu. Yo yaaba na minywa mya nzo kuumi na myole. Bapofi kuumi na boole baakakeelese minywa mya nzo. Ŋa yulu minywa mya nzo, baaba baasonehe manduhi ma bibaandu bikuumi na byole bya baana ba Isereli: <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Hwaba na minywa mya nzo pasi tsyelo: hu Esete mitatu, hu Noode mitatu, mitatu hu Sude, mitatu hu Wesete <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Ibaha hi musyenge hyaba hyateleme ŋa yulu bibeene kuumi na byole. Ŋa yulu a byo baasonehe manduhi ma biluumbi kuumi na byole bya Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Pofi wu akayambili na me aba akaanga hyetso hi litsootso hya mu wolo, mu tooni uvolo hyetso hi musyenge, hi minywa mya nzo a nde na hi ibaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40.3</ref></char></note> hya nde. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Matsyelo moosi mamana ma musyenge, maaba bula pila mosi. Bula bu musyenge aba tsiitsa na taha a nde. Pofi avoli hyetso hi musyenge mu litsootso la nde: bula bu musyenge bwosi bwaba, byetso biveeve kuumi na byole (12 000) bi basitade<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sitade </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hyetso hi hyayelemene na bametere makama moole (200).</char></note>. Bula, na taha na mutaabu a nde, byaba pila mosi. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Nde ayehili kaka hyetso hi ibaha: kama maku mana na mana (144) ma hyetso hya mboŋonyo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hyetso hya mboŋonyo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hyetso hyumata tsoso mileembo natee ŋa mboŋonyo (itini hya metere).</char></note> mu mutaabu, we bu hwaba hyetso hi pofi hakasalila. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Mumbu aba baatunga mu yasipe, na musyenge nde mwakulu aba mu wolo li laatsyeme, li libaamwedeme we mulingu. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Bibeene bi ibaha hi musyenge baaba baayolo byo mu mamanya ma talu, ma pila mu pila: ibeene hyatsomi aba mu manya la yasipe, hya byole hyaba mu manya la safiire, hi bitatu mu manya la angate, hi bina mu manya la emelode, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />hi mutaanu mu manya la onise, hi musamunu mu manya la saledwani. Ibeene hya tsambu hyaba mu manya la kisolite, hya pwombo mu manya la belile, hi ipfwa mu manya la topase, hya kuumi mu manya la kisopase, hya kuumi na imosi mu manya la tukwase, na hya kuumi na byole mu manya la ametite. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Minywa mya nzo kuumi na myole myaba bilabu kuumi na byole. Pasi munywa a nzo aba baasa mu ilabu ndulu imosi. Litandala li musyenge laaba mu wolo li laatsyeme, ubaamwedeme we mulingu.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Me a hamoni nzo a Nzambi mutso musyenge mo wuuna ve, mu tooni ati, nzo a Nzambi musyenge, ni Pfumu, Nzambi Pungu matwala, na Mwana Limeme. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Musyenge a hali na nzala tso taangu ve, tso tsungi ve mu uyalusa nde. Muyusu a Nzambi ubaayalusa nde, na Mwana Limeme ni mwinda a musyenge mo wuuna. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Mabuli moosi sa mabaadyata mu liyalala la nde, na batumi baa toto sa babehe muyusu a bo huuna. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Minywa mya nzo mi musyenge sa mibaaba bwasi muyilala woosi. Mu tooni ati, butsuhu a buubweba ve. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Bo sa babita muyusu na butsitu bu mabuli moosi. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ka isiha tso imosi hi hyasumaha a hyutwala ukoto mu musyenge mo wuuna ve. Muutu nga mavaanga ma nzododo na muutu nga mapfuta utwala ukoto kaka mu nde ve. Ka ndulu baatu ba baasonehe manduhi ma bo mu libuuku la moonyi li lili libuuku la Mwana Limeme<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:1">Esa 52.1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:3-5">60.3-5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 60:19-20">19-20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 44:9">Ezk 44.9</ref></char></note>, buukoto mu musyenge mo wuuna.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Pofi amweesi me kaka nzali wu munene wa mamba ma moonyi, wu akamwedeme we manya li mulingu. Nzali mo akapala hutso a kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi na hya Mwana Limeme, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />na akayene ŋa butima bu litandala li musyenge. Muti a moonyi ayala manganzi mu pasi simu la nzali. Nde ubaabuta mbutu mbuta kuumi na yoole mu ilima, buta limosi mu pasi tsuungi. Makaya ma nde bubaasalila mo mu ubeeloso mabuli. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Huuna a hubweba na isiha tso imosi hi hyuba na tsingili a Nzambi ve. Kiti-ipfumu hya Nzambi na ya Mwana Limeme sa yiba hutso musyenge, na basalili ba Nzambi buukuunda nde. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Bo sa bamono hiinzi hya nde, na nduhi a nde sa basonehe mu mabunzu ma bo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Butsuhu a buubweba ve, na bo a buubweba na nzala liyalala la mwinda tso la taangu ve, mu tooni ati, Pfumu Nzambi upuhala bo liyalala la nde. Na bo sa batuma mu bilima na bilima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:19">Esa 60.19</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:18">Dan 7.18</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziili a Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Titswene, Pofi aleeli me: «Mambu mo maniima mali ma mbuli na ma usiila hiitu. Na Pfumu Nzambi wu asalili mimbihuli, amiitsindaha pofi a nde mu umweese huli basalili ba nde, mambu ma mu uya hu busu.» <verse eid="REV 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Yisu ti: «Yuha, me a taamba mu uya ve! Kinya yili na ba bali mu ukeelese mambu ma mbihulili ma libuuku mo linili!» <verse eid="REV 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Me Yowani, me anzuhi na me amoni mambu mo maana. Bu me amani uyuha na umono mo, me ambwidi ŋa miilu mya pofi wu amweesi me mo, mu ukuunda nde. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ka pofi aleeli me: «Kele, a sa buuna ve! Me musalili we we me ndi, we baana ba ngu ba we mimbihuli, na we boosi ba bali mu ukeelese mambu ma libuuku mo linili. Ndulu Nzambi we afwana ukongemene<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12.10</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Titswene nde abweleele: «A swehe mambu ma mbihulili ma libuuku mo liniili ve mu tooni ati, taangu yi Nzambi haakese mu utswihasa misamu mo miniimi yika bebele. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Nyaha muutu wu ubaasa bubi, abaahwada mu ubaasa bubi, na muutu wu li wu asumaha abaahwada mu ubaasumaha. Muutu wu li mu usa mavaanga ma mabwe abaahwada mu ubaasa buuna. Muutu wu li wa ngidi, abaahwada hutso bungidi bwa nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:10">Dan 12.10</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Yisu ti: «Yuha, me a taamba mu uya ve! Me tsa mbehe musyendo buuve tsundusu a muutu muutu we bu hu li mavaanga ma nde. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Me ni <char style="tl">Alafa na Omenga</char>, watsomi na wa tsyelele, mbandihili na tsukusu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 28:4">Mkg 28.4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:10">Esa 40.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 62:11">62.11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:10">Yel 17.10</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Kinya yili na ba bali mu uswaha bikutu bya bo, mana bo babaha muswa mu udya mbutu muti a moonyi na ukoto hutso musyenge mu minywa mya nzo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:9">Mba 2.9</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ka hu mbadi musyenge hu li na: bamvwa, ba bali mu usalila bungaanga, banga bumbembo, badubi, basambili ba binzanzambi na boosi ba baatondo mapfuta na usalila mo!<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />«Me Yisu, me miitsindaha pofi a me mu uyabisa benu maana moosi, ma baatsindaha huli mabundu. Me ni wu imbisa hya nzo a Davidi. Mvwelele wu ubaamwedeme pasi ngwali.» <verse eid="REV 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Livupu na Mukadi bali mu uleele: «Yaanga!» Nyaha wu li mu uyuha aleele: «Yaanga!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Nyaha wu li na peyu a mamba aya. Nyaha wu toondi mamba ma moonyi ayaka mo bungodu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Esa 55.1</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Me Yowani, me ndi mu unzibusa mu mifudi myosi, wu li mu uyuha mambu ma mbihulili a libuuku mo linili: tso muutu bwesi isiha imosi, Nzambi sa abwese ŋa yulu a nde mapasi, we bu baasonehe mutso libuuku mo linili. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Na tso muutu maasi isiha ŋa yulu a mambu ma mbihulili a libuuku<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:2">Pfu 4.2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:1">13.1</ref></char></note> mo linili, Nzambi sa amaasa ikuuku hya nde hya mbutu muti a moonyi. Nzambi sa amaasa kaka ikuuku hya nde mu musyenge a ngidi, hi baasonehe mutso libuuku mo linili.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Mbangi wu li mu uyabisa imbuli hya mambu mo maniima moosi, li mu uleele: «Eye, me a taamba mu uya ve!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen! Yaanga Pfumu Yisu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Nyaha hyese hya Pfumu Yisu hiba na benu boosi!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>